# Compiled into python-test.txt beside this file with every artifact's SHA-256, and CI installs
# that file with `pip install --require-hashes`, so pip installs only the files hashed
# there. Regenerate it after any edit here:
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.10 \
#     .github/requirements/python-test.in -o .github/requirements/python-test.txt
# The python-test job's type check and test dependencies; the bridge-parity jobs
# install the same file for pytest and pytest-asyncio.
